{"text":"What does that even mean? Well, reading to children the same way people read to us, you can buy books for children who are in Title I schools who might not have books of their own. We do a lot of this at Parnassus. You can speak out against book banning. Because books are not the things endangering our children. And speak up for teachers and librarians who are doing the jobs that they've been trained for. Also, you can just read a book. Do you wish that people read books instead of say constantly scrolling on their phones then read books? Do you want your children to be readers then model that behavior? Of course, you're gonna read to them, but they also have to see you read.","words":[{"text":"What","start":0.0,"end":1.54},{"text":"does","start":1.54,"end":1.7},{"text":"that","start":1.7,"end":2.08},{"text":"even","start":2.08,"end":2.5},{"text":"mean","start":2.5,"end":2.98,"punct":"?"},{"text":"Well","start":4.58,"end":4.58,"punct":","},{"text":"reading","start":5.02,"end":5.3},{"text":"to","start":5.3,"end":5.56},{"text":"children","start":5.56,"end":6.08},{"text":"the","start":6.08,"end":6.62},{"text":"same","start":6.62,"end":6.86},{"text":"way","start":6.86,"end":7.12},{"text":"people","start":7.12,"end":7.52},{"text":"read","start":7.52,"end":7.86},{"text":"to","start":7.86,"end":8.22},{"text":"us","start":8.22,"end":8.76,"punct":","},{"text":"you","start":9.74,"end":10.14},{"text":"can","start":10.14,"end":10.42},{"text":"buy","start":10.42,"end":10.86},{"text":"books","start":10.86,"end":11.28},{"text":"for","start":11.28,"end":11.82},{"text":"children","start":11.82,"end":12.3},{"text":"who","start":12.3,"end":12.92},{"text":"are","start":12.92,"end":13.28},{"text":"in","start":13.28,"end":13.72},{"text":"Title","start":13.72,"end":14.1},{"text":"I","start":14.1,"end":14.36},{"text":"schools","start":14.36,"end":15.02},{"text":"who","start":15.02,"end":15.54},{"text":"might","start":15.54,"end":15.84},{"text":"not","start":15.84,"end":16.18},{"te